  },
  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Playing the Game",
    "section": "1.21",
    "heading": "Rolling 20 or 1",
    "lineStart": 212,
    "lineEnd": 216
  },
  "section": "1.21",
  "rulesText": "If you roll a 20 on the d20 (called a “natural 20”) for an attack roll, the attack hits regardless of any modifiers or the target’s AC. This is called a Critical Hit (see “Combat” later in “Playing the Game”).\n\nIf you roll a 1 on the d20 (a “natural 1”) for an attack roll, the attack misses regardless of any modifiers or the target’s AC."
}
